Two points:
1. In your case the 'usage' mechanism seems unduly arbitrary. Why not fit a temporal trend (~T) or equivalently use a time covariate?
2. Simulations suggest temporal variation in detection is not a big deal (Sollmann 2024; SECR book <https://murrayefford.github.io/SECRbook/> Ch 6)

