Subject: Re: SECR with Camera Traps, Binomial count proximity detector VS Poisson count proximity detector
Message-ID: <1SpikQdZOB0.7lVuz1ptAwAJ@secrgroup.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <1SpikQdZOB0.ZJ2oEQbaAQAJ@secrgroup.groups.google.com>
